   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Rash often on palms and soles. May have wart-like lesions on genitals and patchy hair loss. • Treat syphilis 67.",
   "bbox": [
    51.0,
    363.0,
    283.6,
    393.2
