   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Non-specific viral rash likely • Patient may have temperature ≥ 38°C, headache, lymphadenopathy, muscle pain/body aches. • Reassure rash will resolve on its own. • If fever or pain, give paracetamol 500mg-1g 4-6 hourly (up to 4g in 24 hours) as needed for up to 5 days.",
