   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "1HIV can be transmitted via exposure to infectious body fluids, through sexual contact (rape/sexual assault or consensual sex, burst condom), occupational or non-occupational exposure (sharps injury, splash to eye/mouth/nose/broken skin), sharing needles, contact with used condom and exposure to blood.",
